+constexpr int camp_aggro_phases = 3;
+// camp_aggro.cc: the waker acts last in our team while near the group it woke, wins ties against a settled
+// enemy acting first, and (camp_escape 1) steps off tiles the group could fire on it from; camp_escape 2:
+// every body of ours near an awake Monolith group no ally claims.
